Subject: [CANDIDATE] freedreno/a3xx: cull independent draw IBs outside a GMEM tile

Private opt-in prototype (FD3_SCISSOR_IB=true), not production enabled.
Split a large framebuffer's draw stream on small scissors; group consecutive
draws sharing the same scissor and emit complete state at each group entry. Omit a chunk only when its inclusive scissor
cannot intersect the tile. Disable VSC binning for these batches: omitting
draw packets must not desynchronize the visibility stream. Queries and
streamout are excluded; unexpected appended commands prevent chunk culling.
Small framebuffers retain the ordinary path to avoid per-draw state overhead.
Original precision, pixel coverage, blending, clears and memory barriers are
preserved. Default behavior is unchanged. Optional FD3_SCISSOR_LOG emits CPU
statistics only. Broader correctness and GUI performance acceptance pending.

